WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:05.240
Your heart is shouting,

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:08.260
"Be strong and sad!"

00:00:07.950 --> 00:00:10.290
Just a little more,

00:00:09.690 --> 00:00:12.180
Just a little bit more,

00:00:11.940 --> 00:00:16.720
Raise your hands!

00:00:16.820 --> 00:00:22.910
Tokimeki Memorial

00:00:23.350 --> 00:00:27.550
I'm sure you won't realize it,

00:00:27.240 --> 00:00:31.760
But you're the same as you always were.

00:00:31.160 --> 00:00:36.490
You smiled at me,

00:00:37.090 --> 00:00:42.520
Like a leaf swaying in the wind.

00:00:41.920 --> 00:00:49.240
It seems as though my heart is going to explode.

00:00:49.040 --> 00:00:54.330
Your heart is shouting,

00:00:53.910 --> 00:00:57.020
"Be strong and sad!"

00:00:56.850 --> 00:00:59.160
Just a little more,

00:00:58.560 --> 00:01:01.050
Just a little bit more,

00:01:00.700 --> 00:01:04.970
Raise your hands!

00:01:04.590 --> 00:01:09.620
Someday, you will be gentle,

00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:12.820
And understand what I'm saying to you!

00:01:12.480 --> 00:01:16.640
It'll be all right, no matter where you go,

00:01:16.290 --> 00:01:21.660
This excitement will never stop!

00:01:38.070 --> 00:01:39.240
Here's the next one.

00:01:39.240 --> 00:01:39.490
Okay!

00:01:40.660 --> 00:01:41.370
Take that!

00:01:47.290 --> 00:01:50.080
Otama-san even practices hard in the morning.

00:01:50.080 --> 00:01:53.250
She's got to train hard now that she's the captain.

00:01:53.920 --> 00:01:54.840
Yeah.

00:01:54.840 --> 00:02:02.470
During the spring training camp, students who were trained by her said they saw a demon.

00:02:02.930 --> 00:02:03.890
Oh.

00:02:04.470 --> 00:02:10.440
But a girl with such strict training techniques... is really cool!!

00:02:11.480 --> 00:02:14.230
Yeah! She's cool! She's really cool!

00:02:14.940 --> 00:02:17.110
Tsukasa-chan! Do your best!

00:02:17.110 --> 00:02:18.110
That's it! That's the way!

00:02:18.860 --> 00:02:20.410
Good work, Tsukasa.

00:02:21.030 --> 00:02:22.070
Oh, Ayame.

00:02:22.620 --> 00:02:24.450
I'm tired today, too.

00:02:24.740 --> 00:02:27.000
Never mind that, Tsukasa.

00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:30.540
The boys from the other clubs were cheering you on.

00:02:30.960 --> 00:02:32.130
Oh, really?

00:02:32.130 --> 00:02:33.590
I didn't notice.

00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:35.300
That's what I mean.

00:02:35.590 --> 00:02:38.670
Are you not interested in boys, Tsukasa?

00:02:41.550 --> 00:02:42.930
That's not true!

00:02:42.930 --> 00:02:46.470
I also think it'd be nice to have a boyfriend!

00:02:46.770 --> 00:02:48.480
Then why don't you get one?

00:02:48.480 --> 00:02:50.690
You could have anyone you want.

00:02:52.310 --> 00:02:53.190
You're too naive.

00:02:54.110 --> 00:02:58.530
I want an exciting meeting that I'm fated to have!

00:02:59.700 --> 00:03:02.030
A meeting she's fated to have, eh?

00:03:09.080 --> 00:03:13.500
I'll use the materials shown on your monitors for class today.

00:03:14.170 --> 00:03:16.710
Please read through the materials first.

00:03:21.090 --> 00:03:21.840
He is...

00:03:22.180 --> 00:03:23.050
Um...

00:03:23.510 --> 00:03:26.260
He doesn't look that special...

00:03:26.890 --> 00:03:30.310
You said it was urgent, but however you look at it...

00:03:31.270 --> 00:03:31.980
he's pathetic.

00:03:32.140 --> 00:03:33.690
It's too soon to jump to conclusions.

00:03:34.310 --> 00:03:36.520
Please look at this first.

00:03:41.030 --> 00:03:42.530
He runs so fast!

00:03:42.530 --> 00:03:43.450
You see?

00:03:43.910 --> 00:03:47.160
Don't you think that his running speed would improve with the right training?

00:03:47.620 --> 00:03:48.790
I want him in my club.

00:03:49.370 --> 00:03:51.910
Yes, he could be a regular member soon.

00:03:52.870 --> 00:03:55.630
Well then, will that be acceptable?

00:03:55.630 --> 00:03:56.840
I won't bother.

00:03:58.710 --> 00:04:01.220
Boys aren't needed in the girls' volleyball club, after all.

00:04:01.510 --> 00:04:02.130
That's true...

00:04:03.430 --> 00:04:05.550
So, what are our plans?

00:04:06.260 --> 00:04:08.060
What about our usual plan?

00:04:08.470 --> 00:04:13.560
I think his true abilities can be determined by utilizing contests...

00:04:13.810 --> 00:04:20.280
Well then, I'll let all the club captains know about what's going on.

00:04:21.650 --> 00:04:23.150
I'm looking forward to this, Aoba-kun!

00:04:23.360 --> 00:04:27.580
I'll put all my strength into it and beat you!

00:04:29.950 --> 00:04:33.410
Matsuoka-sensei, what are they doing?

00:04:34.290 --> 00:04:35.330
Good grief.

00:04:35.330 --> 00:04:36.460
It's spring, after all.

00:04:36.960 --> 00:04:38.170
Just leave them alone.

00:04:38.840 --> 00:04:43.170
Well then, Iwamoto and three others will organize the race.

00:04:46.340 --> 00:04:47.340
Okay!

00:04:48.720 --> 00:04:52.060
All that's left is the mixed relay.

00:04:52.810 --> 00:04:54.940
Who'd like to run in the relay?

00:04:57.440 --> 00:04:59.020
I'll run in the mixed relay!

00:04:59.230 --> 00:05:00.900
I'll run too!

00:05:01.150 --> 00:05:02.610
I'll run!

00:05:02.990 --> 00:05:04.780
I'll bring the horse!

00:05:04.950 --> 00:05:07.360
Why's everyone so eager to run?

00:05:07.570 --> 00:05:09.450
You don't understand a thing.

00:05:10.120 --> 00:05:11.330
It's about Amamiya.

00:05:11.540 --> 00:05:12.500
About Amamiya-san?

00:05:13.200 --> 00:05:13.750
What do you mean?

00:05:13.750 --> 00:05:15.960
Put simply, they want to be close to her.

00:05:18.040 --> 00:05:19.290
There's a story behind it.

00:05:25.840 --> 00:05:28.010
It happened on Sports Day last year.

00:05:31.350 --> 00:05:36.100
Amamiya-san was chosen to be with three guys for the cavalry battle last year.

00:05:31.350 --> 00:05:36.100
(Note: An event where teams have to push the top member from other teams off.)

00:05:37.730 --> 00:05:40.900
When Amamiya's horse appeared on the field,

00:05:42.530 --> 00:05:49.620
hundreds of participants were awed by her beauty, and opened a path for her.

00:05:51.240 --> 00:05:54.040
That's part of Amamiya's legend?

00:05:54.500 --> 00:05:55.370
I guess.

00:05:55.830 --> 00:06:00.330
This is their chance to get close to Amamiya.

00:06:00.580 --> 00:06:07.970
And whoever gets to be Amamiya's partner will be famous throughout the school.

00:06:08.760 --> 00:06:10.510
There's no happiness that even comes close.

00:06:10.800 --> 00:06:12.470
Is that how it is?

00:06:12.470 --> 00:06:13.970
OF COURSE IT IS!

00:06:13.970 --> 00:06:16.430
Well, I'll also participate...

00:06:16.060 --> 00:06:18.940
The rest of you will participate in the mixed relay.

00:06:20.560 --> 00:06:22.060
Weren't you listening?

00:06:22.820 --> 00:06:28.610
Kayama-kun, Suzuki-kun, and Aoba-kun were assigned to the relay, since no one else volunteered.

00:06:28.900 --> 00:06:30.570
It looks like it'll be quite hectic this year.

00:06:30.780 --> 00:06:33.700
But... I can't run in a relay!

00:06:33.700 --> 00:06:35.040
We want to be in the cavalry battle!

00:06:35.040 --> 00:06:37.410
You're terrible! You just assigned us on your own!

00:06:38.000 --> 00:06:40.370
Then stop complaining.

00:06:40.370 --> 00:06:41.670
You volunteered to participate, didn't you?

00:06:42.210 --> 00:06:44.380
Come on. Get ready for it.

00:06:44.380 --> 00:06:45.340
Okay.

00:06:45.920 --> 00:06:46.590
Everyone.

00:06:49.130 --> 00:06:50.010
Do your best, all right?

00:06:52.890 --> 00:06:55.600
Come to think of it, what is Sayuri participating in?

00:06:56.020 --> 00:06:58.390
She participated in the cavalry battle and the relay last year.

00:06:58.770 --> 00:07:01.440
Yeah, of course she would participate in the relay...

00:07:01.850 --> 00:07:04.190
But what about the cavalry battle, Amamiya-san?

00:07:04.770 --> 00:07:05.610
Sorry.

00:07:06.360 --> 00:07:12.280
I need to help with the administrative duties, so it looks like I can only participate in the relay.

00:07:13.490 --> 00:07:14.530
WHAAAAT?!

00:07:15.240 --> 00:07:20.580
I heard that you'll be provided with gold headbands if we come in first overall this year.

00:07:21.250 --> 00:07:23.290
Try hard, everyone!

00:07:23.540 --> 00:07:24.840
Yes!

00:07:25.380 --> 00:07:27.960
Well then, I'll continue the lesson.

00:07:28.210 --> 00:07:28.960
Boys.

00:07:29.300 --> 00:07:31.630
Don't burn yourselves out. Follow me!

00:07:36.680 --> 00:07:39.140
This class is full of morons.

00:07:40.600 --> 00:07:43.730
Thanks for waiting. Here's your chocolate danish and croissant.

00:07:44.560 --> 00:07:47.070
This is iced coffee, and this is a fruit sandwich.

00:07:47.070 --> 00:07:48.030
Yes, yes, yes!

00:07:48.730 --> 00:07:50.150
Where's my pork sandwich?

00:07:50.150 --> 00:07:51.650
Here's your sausage roll.

00:07:52.070 --> 00:07:53.990
Sorry! I'll get some for you right away.

00:07:54.660 --> 00:08:01.000
So we'll end up participating in the relay with Amamiya-san.

00:08:01.500 --> 00:08:03.830
Well, we've just gotta do it now.

00:08:04.290 --> 00:08:05.670
But it's a relay.

00:08:05.960 --> 00:08:08.210
If we do badly, we might lose our lives.

00:08:09.050 --> 00:08:10.210
Why would we lose our lives?

00:08:10.210 --> 00:08:11.840
Aoba Riku!

00:08:17.220 --> 00:08:19.140
Um... I-I-I...

00:08:19.140 --> 00:08:21.810
Did I do something...

00:08:22.020 --> 00:08:23.190
Aoba Riku!

00:08:23.190 --> 00:08:24.810
We challenge you!

00:08:24.810 --> 00:08:27.150
Ch-Challenge?!

00:08:28.190 --> 00:08:29.570
C-Could this be...

00:08:30.230 --> 00:08:31.530
Th-The sport clubs...

00:08:32.190 --> 00:08:33.820
What do you mean "the sport clubs"?

00:08:34.110 --> 00:08:35.450
What's going on?!

00:08:35.450 --> 00:08:37.160
Let's go!

00:08:38.870 --> 00:08:41.410
Here's your bread. Thanks for waiting.

00:08:42.830 --> 00:08:44.080
Thanks for-

00:08:53.340 --> 00:08:54.970
My precious bread! My precious bread is...

00:08:57.970 --> 00:08:59.350
My precious bread is...

00:09:00.970 --> 00:09:02.730
My precious cargo is...

00:09:06.770 --> 00:09:08.400
Where do you think you're going?

00:09:08.810 --> 00:09:10.480
There's nowhere to run!

00:09:10.980 --> 00:09:12.990
Give yourself up quietly and join us!

00:09:12.990 --> 00:09:14.610
But...

00:09:15.150 --> 00:09:16.160
We've...

00:09:16.160 --> 00:09:18.280
Got nothing to do with him!

00:09:18.280 --> 00:09:18.990
Oh no!

00:09:24.540 --> 00:09:25.790
How dare you!

00:09:26.870 --> 00:09:30.630
You ruined my bread!

00:09:32.050 --> 00:09:37.300
I will teach you what I do to people who ruin my business!

00:09:44.060 --> 00:09:45.520
Well then, transfer student.

00:09:46.140 --> 00:09:47.020
What'll you do now?

00:09:47.310 --> 00:09:50.020
He rejected the offers from the sports clubs.

00:09:50.650 --> 00:09:51.270
Y-Yes.

00:09:51.610 --> 00:09:55.530
He didn't do anything. He just did it by accident.

00:09:56.070 --> 00:09:57.700
He doesn't just have ability.

00:09:58.030 --> 00:09:59.660
He's lucky as well.

00:10:00.950 --> 00:10:02.620
As I thought, he's exceptional.

00:10:03.700 --> 00:10:05.290
Well, what should we do next?

00:10:06.910 --> 00:10:07.710
I'll go.

00:10:08.830 --> 00:10:11.290
I'm interested in his legs.

00:10:12.130 --> 00:10:15.300
Don't hold it against me if I win.

00:10:19.720 --> 00:10:21.430
The real fight starts now.

00:10:21.720 --> 00:10:22.970
Aoba-kun!

00:10:24.100 --> 00:10:24.390
Tokimeki Memorial: Only Love

00:10:29.140 --> 00:10:32.440
I'm Koayu. I'm Yuuka. I'm Ayame.

00:10:35.650 --> 00:10:37.070
Why'd it end up like this?

00:10:37.440 --> 00:10:40.990
I just want to live a peaceful life at school.

00:10:41.700 --> 00:10:42.910
Why is this happening?

00:10:45.120 --> 00:10:47.960
Wh-When did you get here?

00:10:48.370 --> 00:10:51.880
I'm Doujima Kyouhei, your classmate.

00:10:51.880 --> 00:10:53.340
I... see.

00:10:54.210 --> 00:10:58.010
I've trained to become strong enough to protect Amamiya.

00:10:58.420 --> 00:11:06.680
However, when you defeated me, I realized that I was just a small fry.

00:11:06.680 --> 00:11:08.520
C-Could that be...

00:11:08.730 --> 00:11:12.480
Your feelings for Amamiya are genuine.

00:11:12.860 --> 00:11:16.440
Now you should become a man worthy of protecting Amamiya.

00:11:17.570 --> 00:11:20.650
I'll help you with that.

00:11:21.030 --> 00:11:22.740
Well, I don't know what you're talking about...

00:11:23.530 --> 00:11:26.700
That's my advice to you as a friend.

00:11:26.950 --> 00:11:28.540
A-As a friend?

00:11:28.700 --> 00:11:29.660
You're friends with me?

00:11:30.080 --> 00:11:31.460
Listen up, friend.

00:11:32.370 --> 00:11:34.170
Watch out for the Four Big Sportsmen.

00:11:35.040 --> 00:11:36.590
They're more than they seem.

00:11:38.050 --> 00:11:39.090
Friend?

00:11:42.010 --> 00:11:44.640
Even if he tells me to be careful...

00:11:47.100 --> 00:11:49.430
I've been waiting for you, Aoba-kun!

00:11:49.890 --> 00:11:50.390
Tokimeki!

00:11:50.680 --> 00:11:53.020
I've come to see you run!

00:11:54.150 --> 00:11:58.320
You and I were both chosen by the gods!

00:11:58.610 --> 00:12:00.150
U-Um...

00:12:00.490 --> 00:12:01.820
Are you one of...

00:12:01.950 --> 00:12:02.820
Yes!

00:12:03.030 --> 00:12:08.660
I am one of the Big Four Sportsmen. I am captain of the track club! Kamino Ryouiki!

00:12:09.200 --> 00:12:10.120
Aoba-kun.

00:12:10.120 --> 00:12:11.120
Run with me!

00:12:11.410 --> 00:12:13.290
I challenge you to the 100-meter dash!

00:12:13.290 --> 00:12:15.290
W-Well, I don't mind doing that...

00:12:15.710 --> 00:12:16.290
I see.

00:12:16.630 --> 00:12:17.590
Then let us begin.

00:12:26.680 --> 00:12:28.140
I knew they'd pick Aoba.

00:12:28.390 --> 00:12:30.060
The track club captain singled him out.

00:12:30.270 --> 00:12:31.980
It hasn't started yet.

00:12:32.310 --> 00:12:34.190
This will be useful.

00:12:36.150 --> 00:12:40.110
I feel sorry for you, since you accepted without knowing my ability.

00:12:40.690 --> 00:12:43.780
I'll run 100 meters first to give you a handicap.

00:12:43.780 --> 00:12:45.490
What? A contest?

00:12:48.410 --> 00:12:48.990
Tokimeki!

00:12:51.040 --> 00:12:51.790
He's fast!

00:12:52.330 --> 00:12:56.670
If you understand my true skills, run with me in a 100 meter contest!

00:12:57.080 --> 00:12:58.000
Well...

00:12:58.290 --> 00:12:59.880
What do you mean, a "contest"?

00:13:00.340 --> 00:13:02.010
We're just running.

00:13:02.260 --> 00:13:06.130
If I win, you must join the track club.

00:13:06.130 --> 00:13:07.550
That's all.

00:13:07.550 --> 00:13:09.720
But... You never told me about that!

00:13:09.510 --> 00:13:10.720
I didn't, did I?

00:13:11.140 --> 00:13:12.220
Come on. Let's go!

00:13:12.220 --> 00:13:13.310
So you say, but...

00:13:13.310 --> 00:13:13.930
Ready!

00:13:15.810 --> 00:13:18.440
I'll have to join the track club at this rate!

00:13:18.730 --> 00:13:24.110
I thought you'd be better at this, but you can't win against my beautiful technique!

00:13:24.860 --> 00:13:25.530
Senpai!

00:13:25.860 --> 00:13:27.110
You're off-form!

00:13:29.280 --> 00:13:30.780
You aren't lifting your legs high enough!

00:13:30.780 --> 00:13:34.040
You aren't living up to your ideal running form!

00:13:34.040 --> 00:13:35.710
Th-That can't be!

00:13:35.960 --> 00:13:36.960
I... I...

00:13:36.960 --> 00:13:39.040
How could I forget about running beautifully?

00:13:39.040 --> 00:13:41.040
Is this high enough?

00:13:41.250 --> 00:13:42.460
How about this?

00:13:45.670 --> 00:13:47.010
I... I won.

00:13:50.100 --> 00:13:52.560
He forgot about the contest right in the middle of it.

00:13:52.560 --> 00:13:53.140
Kamino!

00:13:53.350 --> 00:13:56.020
Um... Can I try next?

00:13:57.310 --> 00:13:59.100
Do you have a strategy, Utsuno?

00:13:59.730 --> 00:14:00.400
Yes.

00:14:04.610 --> 00:14:06.030
That was a close one this afternoon.

00:14:06.820 --> 00:14:08.860
Icchi saved me.

00:14:09.320 --> 00:14:09.780
Huh?

00:14:10.530 --> 00:14:11.280
What could this be?

00:14:15.580 --> 00:14:17.040
What?! This is...

00:14:17.830 --> 00:14:18.750
<i>Aoba-san.</i>

00:14:18.960 --> 00:14:20.580
<i>Sorry for sending you this letter so suddenly.</i>

00:14:20.920 --> 00:14:26.340
<i>If it's all right with you, would you please meet me after school at the large pool in the gym?</i>

00:14:26.340 --> 00:14:27.050
<i>I'll be waiting.</i>

00:14:28.090 --> 00:14:29.550
A-Ayu-san?

00:14:44.150 --> 00:14:46.230
Huh? I'm sure he is...

00:14:46.610 --> 00:14:48.200
Where's Ayu-san?

00:14:49.740 --> 00:14:53.450
I knew that a boy couldn't resist a such a letter.

00:14:57.120 --> 00:14:59.580
Welcome to the swimming club, Aoba-san!

00:15:00.710 --> 00:15:02.580
Then... you wrote this letter?

00:15:03.170 --> 00:15:03.790
Yes.

00:15:04.040 --> 00:15:09.090
I am the captain of the swimming club, Utsumi Koayu.

00:15:09.720 --> 00:15:13.890
Won't you please join me, as another member of the swimming club?

00:15:14.260 --> 00:15:16.010
That's too one-sided!

00:15:16.010 --> 00:15:16.970
I'm going home!

00:15:19.270 --> 00:15:20.730
Not again...

00:15:21.440 --> 00:15:26.480
I'll let you choose your handicap for this contest.

00:15:26.860 --> 00:15:29.490
What is your best stroke, Utsumi-san?

00:15:29.740 --> 00:15:32.200
I won the National High School Butterfly Stroke Competition two years in a row!

00:15:32.160 --> 00:15:33.620
(Text says, She won the National High School Butterfly Stroke Competition two years in a row!)

00:15:33.620 --> 00:15:35.700
Th-Then let's do the front crawl.

00:15:35.700 --> 00:15:36.620
All right.

00:15:39.960 --> 00:15:41.620
W-Wow!

00:15:47.590 --> 00:15:50.880
No! Please don't look at me like that!

00:15:50.880 --> 00:15:51.970
Don't defile our Senpai's breasts!

00:15:51.970 --> 00:15:53.470
Get a towel! Someone get a towel!

00:15:55.100 --> 00:15:56.350
U-Um...

00:15:56.350 --> 00:15:57.470
What about the contest?

00:15:57.470 --> 00:15:58.850
Now's not the time for that!

00:15:59.060 --> 00:15:59.640
Senpai!

00:15:59.810 --> 00:16:00.560
Get a hold of yourself!

00:16:00.560 --> 00:16:02.190
Please get a hold of yourself!

00:16:02.890 --> 00:16:04.730
Okay, then I'll... go this way!

00:16:05.230 --> 00:16:06.360
Utsumi-senpai...

00:16:08.230 --> 00:16:09.030
Aoba-san...

00:16:12.860 --> 00:16:14.360
I've gotta get home!

00:16:14.360 --> 00:16:15.990
I've been waiting for you, Aoba-kun.

00:16:15.990 --> 00:16:16.950
There's ANOTHER one!

00:16:17.530 --> 00:16:20.370
I'm impressed that you managed to defeat two of the Four Big Sportsmen.

00:16:20.700 --> 00:16:21.460
However!

00:16:21.460 --> 00:16:26.500
I, the captain of the baseball club, Ishiuchi Ichiro, will not go down so easily!

00:16:26.840 --> 00:16:27.840
Um... I...

00:16:27.840 --> 00:16:29.590
I'm not interested in baseball...

00:16:30.090 --> 00:16:32.510
If possible, I would like to decline your challenge...

00:16:32.510 --> 00:16:34.260
Aw, don't say that, Aoba-kun.

00:16:35.220 --> 00:16:36.140
S-Sakurai-kun?!

00:16:36.550 --> 00:16:39.720
If you were going to have so much fun, you should've told me sooner!

00:16:39.890 --> 00:16:43.520
I know this is sudden, but we'll have your contest as a Student Council event!

00:16:43.980 --> 00:16:45.100
I have no objections.

00:16:45.100 --> 00:16:46.520
All right, Ishiuchi-san!

00:16:46.810 --> 00:16:48.270
You understand me!

00:16:48.270 --> 00:16:50.280
But... what about MY opinion?!

00:16:50.280 --> 00:16:53.110
How about having a pitching/hitting showdown?

00:16:53.110 --> 00:16:54.700
Oh, what rules should we have?

00:16:54.700 --> 00:16:55.700
Who wants to bat?

00:16:55.700 --> 00:16:57.120
Fight

00:17:08.250 --> 00:17:10.500
No one can hit my pitches!

00:17:11.000 --> 00:17:14.090
It wouldn't be fair if you were the pitcher, Ishiuchi.

00:17:14.760 --> 00:17:15.380
Okay!

00:17:15.760 --> 00:17:20.470
If Ishiuchi-san can hit one of Aoba-kun's pitches, Aoba-kun will join the baseball club.

00:17:20.970 --> 00:17:24.560
If Ishiuchi-san fails to hit one of Aoba-kun's pitches,

00:17:24.560 --> 00:17:26.600
Aoba-kun receives a "Super Rare Item" from the Student Council as a present!

00:17:27.100 --> 00:17:28.100
No, you don't have to...

00:17:28.690 --> 00:17:29.730
Very well then!

00:17:29.980 --> 00:17:31.530
We'll have our contest on the baseball field.

00:17:36.740 --> 00:17:38.700
Why do I have to suffer so?

00:17:40.700 --> 00:17:42.120
Hiyoko-kun.

00:17:40.700 --> 00:17:42.120
(Note: Hiyoko means chick.)

00:17:42.500 --> 00:17:43.390
Do you want to win?

00:17:45.870 --> 00:17:47.670
W-Well, I'd like to win.

00:17:47.800 --> 00:17:48.850
So don't give up.

00:17:48.900 --> 00:17:50.130
If you give up it's over,you know.

00:17:50.460 --> 00:17:51.250
Don't give up.

00:17:51.710 --> 00:17:53.340
"If you give up, it's all over?"

00:17:54.270 --> 00:17:55.070
Let's Go Riku!

00:17:55.200 --> 00:17:56.320
It's time to Train!

00:17:58.430 --> 00:17:59.720
Hey, wait!

00:18:00.180 --> 00:18:01.890
A special training course?!

00:18:01.750 --> 00:18:02.500
Goooooooooooo!!

00:18:02.850 --> 00:18:04.430
Like I said...

00:18:03.780 --> 00:18:04.820
No complaints!!

00:18:04.980 --> 00:18:06.810
I...

00:18:05.960 --> 00:18:06.590
You will...

00:18:06.810 --> 00:18:08.230
don't wanna...

00:18:08.030 --> 00:18:10.130
because you're a...

00:18:08.980 --> 00:18:11.940
do a special training course!!!

00:18:15.820 --> 00:18:17.280
This way, Sayuri.

00:18:18.240 --> 00:18:21.990
Aoba-kun got mixed up in another one of Sakurai's schemes.

00:18:22.830 --> 00:18:26.500
Well, I think that if Ishiuchi-san can't hit one of his pitches, Aoba-kun will win.

00:18:27.290 --> 00:18:28.870
If he can't hit it, right?

00:18:31.290 --> 00:18:32.000
So you've come.

00:18:33.460 --> 00:18:36.920
You look like you've done some special training.

00:18:37.920 --> 00:18:39.840
But you can't fool me!

00:18:41.010 --> 00:18:43.050
Let's get started, Aoba-kun!

00:18:44.390 --> 00:18:45.970
Okay then, play ball!

00:18:46.270 --> 00:18:47.560
Bring it on!

00:18:57.320 --> 00:18:58.240
A dead ball...

00:18:58.570 --> 00:19:00.700
When all is said and done, he got hit.

00:19:00.700 --> 00:19:01.950
Isn't that a little cruel?

00:19:02.410 --> 00:19:04.120
Transfer student, you suck!

00:19:04.120 --> 00:19:05.330
Fight fair and square!

00:19:05.700 --> 00:19:08.080
Our transfer student-kun wins the contest!

00:19:11.330 --> 00:19:15.960
Well, I said that if Ishiuchi-san didn't hit the ball, the transfer student would win, didn't I?

00:19:15.960 --> 00:19:16.670
You suck!

00:19:20.720 --> 00:19:22.510
SILENCE!!

00:19:23.890 --> 00:19:28.770
I declared that baseball rules would not apply to this contest.

00:19:29.060 --> 00:19:29.390
Aoba.

00:19:30.230 --> 00:19:30.980
Ishiuchi-san.

00:19:32.190 --> 00:19:33.480
I couldn't dodge the ball.

00:19:34.360 --> 00:19:36.400
Well done, Aoba-kun!

00:19:36.940 --> 00:19:39.740
Well, if Ishiuchi-san understands, then it's okay.

00:19:39.740 --> 00:19:41.240
That was fun.

00:19:41.240 --> 00:19:42.660
You rule, Aoba!

00:19:42.660 --> 00:19:45.830
Well then, Aoba-kun wins this contest!

00:19:45.830 --> 00:19:46.490
YEAH!!!

00:19:46.910 --> 00:19:49.120
Oh, Sakurai-kun's so forceful.

00:19:49.540 --> 00:19:50.910
What's the big deal?

00:19:50.910 --> 00:19:53.380
Everyone's really into it.

00:19:53.380 --> 00:19:54.250
I guess.

00:19:54.250 --> 00:19:54.750
Well done!

00:20:12.480 --> 00:20:13.560
Oh no!

00:20:13.560 --> 00:20:14.650
I'm gonna be late!

00:20:16.900 --> 00:20:18.400
This morning's really invigorating.

00:20:18.980 --> 00:20:22.990
I won't be bothered any more, and a long-overdue day of peace has arrived.

00:20:23.360 --> 00:20:26.160
I don't have morning training today, so I overslept!

00:20:26.160 --> 00:20:27.990
And I'm on duty this week too!

00:20:26.160 --> 00:20:27.990
(Note: In Japan, students take turns cleaning the classrooms at the end of the day.)

00:20:29.290 --> 00:20:29.950
Oh yeah.

00:20:30.540 --> 00:20:33.870
I need to give this bread to Hiyoko-kun to thank him.

00:20:35.330 --> 00:20:36.540
Outta the way!

00:20:42.010 --> 00:20:43.340
Ow-ow-ow-ow-ow.

00:20:43.630 --> 00:20:44.090
Geez.

00:20:44.590 --> 00:20:46.260
Don't just stand there.

00:20:46.550 --> 00:20:48.720
You gave me such a fright.

00:20:50.010 --> 00:20:51.390
S-Sorry.

00:20:51.930 --> 00:20:52.890
Are you all right?

00:20:52.890 --> 00:20:54.810
Of course I'm not all right!

00:20:54.980 --> 00:20:55.900
Geez.

00:20:55.900 --> 00:20:57.860
My uniform's all dirty now.

00:20:58.520 --> 00:21:00.110
Wh-What'll I do?

00:21:00.110 --> 00:21:01.360
A handkerchief...

00:21:01.360 --> 00:21:01.940
I need a handkerchief...

00:21:01.940 --> 00:21:04.400
Never mind that. Help me up, NOW!

00:21:05.200 --> 00:21:05.530
All right.

00:21:09.160 --> 00:21:10.790
Here. Grab my hand.

00:21:11.040 --> 00:21:12.540
O-Okay.

00:21:15.960 --> 00:21:17.710
I'm sorry. It was all my fault.

00:21:19.170 --> 00:21:20.090
Is your uniform okay?

00:21:20.090 --> 00:21:21.800
Could this be...

00:21:20.750 --> 00:21:21.840
Are you hurt?

00:21:27.140 --> 00:21:28.220
Um...

00:21:28.470 --> 00:21:29.100
Yes?

00:21:29.550 --> 00:21:31.100
You're destined to be my man!

00:21:33.480 --> 00:21:36.980
Even someone like me can have such a romantic encounter!

00:21:37.310 --> 00:21:39.270
Hey, where should we go for our first date?

00:21:39.560 --> 00:21:43.070
Oh, but before that, we should get to know each other.

00:21:43.900 --> 00:21:46.860
Because we're lovers, after all!

00:21:50.030 --> 00:21:51.030
H-Hey!

00:21:51.030 --> 00:21:53.330
What do you mean we're lovers?!

00:21:53.580 --> 00:21:55.080
We just met each other!!!

00:21:55.910 --> 00:21:58.370
The length of our relationship doesn't matter!

00:21:58.710 --> 00:22:00.130
This is destiny, after all!

00:22:00.420 --> 00:22:01.920
It's a heart-throbbing meeting!

00:22:02.800 --> 00:22:04.050
Heart-throbbing...

00:22:04.420 --> 00:22:05.840
I don't have a clue about what she's talking about.

00:22:12.680 --> 00:22:15.810
I might lose my life this time...

00:22:16.680 --> 00:22:19.440
Nice to meet you, my dear destined lover!

00:22:31.830 --> 00:22:37.210
When the morning sunlight streams through the window,

00:22:37.040 --> 00:22:42.250
I immediately think of you.

00:22:43.250 --> 00:22:54.220
Our love began at first sight.

00:22:55.140 --> 00:23:00.230
We have a bright future!

00:23:00.270 --> 00:23:06.650
Because you are my destined man!

00:23:06.780 --> 00:23:17.330
I've always been searching for the feeling which broke my smile.

00:23:18.410 --> 00:23:24.340
I have grasped a piece of the miracle which fell into this world

00:23:24.290 --> 00:23:30.260
I will run toward you, my love!

00:23:30.130 --> 00:23:35.930
When we are together, we can overcome any obstacle!

00:23:35.510 --> 00:23:42.560
Our love is still young, but it's my treasure!

00:23:50.110 --> 00:23:50.570
Next Episode Preview. Tokimeki Memorial: Only Love

00:23:50.820 --> 00:23:53.780
Oh, Amamiya-san, where are you going?

00:23:54.070 --> 00:23:55.870
I'm going to the library now that school's over.

00:23:56.030 --> 00:23:57.490
Oh, are you going to borrow a book or something?

00:23:57.830 --> 00:24:01.000
Yes, I'm planning to return the book I borrowed yesterday, borrow a new book, and read that book at the library.

00:23:58.450 --> 00:23:59.580
(Banner: Grudge)

00:24:01.000 --> 00:24:05.960
Then I'm going to borrow a book to read at night, bring a book to read on the way home,

00:24:05.960 --> 00:24:10.800
and buy an interesting book to read at home.

00:24:10.800 --> 00:24:11.170
Grudge

00:24:10.990 --> 00:24:13.170
Next on Tokimeki Memorial Only Love:

00:24:13.520 --> 00:24:14.550
An Exciting Time After School.

00:24:14.800 --> 00:24:15.450
Please watch it.

00:24:15.880 --> 00:24:18.710
How many books do you plan on reading every day?
